{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CAEMDALE</strong> is a roguelike deckbuilder where every decision shapes the fate of your growing city. As you construct new buildings, you'll unlock powerful cards that define your strategy. Carefully chosen <strong>state policies</strong> offer deeper synergy with your deck, enabling new combinations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/b0918663c64be2bbc1abf08f48391ab0.poster.avif?t=1758221157\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/b0918663c64be2bbc1abf08f48391ab0.webm?t=1758221157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/b0918663c64be2bbc1abf08f48391ab0.mp4?t=1758221157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Increase your Prestige</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While building your deck, you must defend your city against relentless <strong>raids</strong> and withstand disruptive <strong>revolutions</strong> that will demolish your deck if they are not prepared for. Manage these challenges to make sure you are prepared to build the critical <strong>prestige</strong> buildings to establish a true empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/4e2a5faad016ec328812403e5cbea8d5.poster.avif?t=1758221157\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/extras/4e2a5faad016ec328812403e5cbea8d5.webm?t=1758221157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720630/e